	(text "Note:\n\nEach CH_{n}/CH_{n+1} pair spans a thermistor in the chamber. \n\nThe thermistors in the chamber are all mutually isolated.\n\nThere are 17 total thermistors in the chamber, labeled 7-24.\n\nThe connection from LTC0/LTC1 to the DB-37 connector (on the \ntop-level sheet, see TABLE 1) dictates which thermistors are \nread out by which LTC2983 channels on which chip."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
